{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the Cozy Beach demo, where you can fish on a beautiful tropical island and hang out with your feline friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Here are all the fun activities you can get up to in the Cozy Beach demo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude38\u00a0Select an adorable preset avatar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa3 Go fishing and try to collect everything in your fish tracking journal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc1f Swim around in a water tube</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd0e Explore Paw Print Island- find all the fun little gathering spots to fish and chill</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb6 Jam out to sweet tunes on the radio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And of course, no day at the beach is complete without hanging out and chatting with your friends in multiplayer \ud83d\udc6f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is currently online only, although you can create a private room to play solo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We're actively working on the demo - here are some of the features we have planned to add in soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Customizable avatars</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Cool apparel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Collectibles &amp; treasures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Friendly NPCs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Drink crafting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Day &amp; night cycles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-More fish &amp; emotes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Split screen play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Local co-op play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Localization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks for checking out the demo and we hope to see you soon at Cozy Beach!\u00a0\ud83c\udfdd</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3785450?t=1750090834","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785450/12a38413b9aec8f0bd212c9c999bd45dfd446c18/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750090834","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785450/0920392c5bdb5f8404b0df9b1370f60900873bbd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750090834","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785450/0920392c5bdb5f8404b0df9b1370f60900873bbd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750090834","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the Cozy Beach demo, where you can fish on a beautiful tropical island and hang out with your feline friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Here are all the fun activities you can get up to in the Cozy Beach demo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude38\u00a0Select an adorable preset avatar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa3 Go fishing and try to collect everything in your fish tracking journal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc1f Swim around in a water tube</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd0e Explore Paw Print Island- find all the fun little gathering spots to fish and chill</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb6 Jam out to sweet tunes on the radio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And of course, no day at the beach is complete without hanging out and chatting with your friends in multiplayer \ud83d\udc6f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is currently online only, although you can create a private room to play solo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We're actively working on the demo - here are some of the features we have planned to add in soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Customizable avatars</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Cool apparel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Collectibles &amp; treasures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Friendly NPCs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Drink crafting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Day &amp; night cycles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-More fish &amp; emotes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Split screen play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Local co-op play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Localization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks for checking out the demo and we hope to see you soon at Cozy Beach!\u00a0\ud83c\udfdd</p>","developers":["LunaBeat"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3489070","name":"Cozy Beach"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785450/0ea51fde012f3ef0d85c216d9e8bcc73c30cc544/header.jpg?t=1750090834","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257157248,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257157248/movie480.mp4?t=1750090829","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257157248/movie_max.mp4?t=1750090829"},"name":"June 2025 Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257157248/41b205acf5eb4abf0da10f4d278147da94d0a2ed/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750090829","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257157248/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1750090829","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257157248/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1750090829"}}],"name":